      "title": "Advisory dated 07.11.2025 — HMF to be considered a quality parameter in Honey",
      "url": "https://fssai.gov.in/upload/advisories/2025/11/690dd80e5809fHMF%20to%20be%20considered%20as%20quality%20parameter%20in%20honey.pdf"
